> ere is no clear difference. The gap between the two dots is an" "association, not the effect of COVID; the gaps are cl
> ear together only if p < 0.05 (here p = 0.56)." "Importers are not like for like (21% of the 2012 firms, 53% of the 20
> 19 firms: the recorded share jumps)." "Firms not in the two files before leave far more partly because of how the fict
